To practice building GenAI pipelines and LLM-based applications (e.g., Text-to-SQL, RAG agents, database memory), mastering the complete SQL command set is essential.
This hands-on, runnable masterclass script uses an **AI Product Catalog & Knowledge Base System** schema.
---
