### Phase 2: Data Control Language (DCL)
*DCL commands manage user access, authentication, and security privileges.*
```sql
-- 1. Create a user role for the GenAI Backend Agent
CREATE USER 'llm_agent_user'@'localhost' IDENTIFIED BY 'SecurePass123!';

-- 2. GRANT: Give specific privileges needed by a query agent
GRANT SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE ON genai_knowledge_db.products TO 'llm_agent_user'@'localhost';
GRANT SELECT, INSERT ON genai_knowledge_db.agent_logs TO 'llm_agent_user'@'localhost';

-- 3. REVOKE: Remove destructive permissions from the agent
REVOKE UPDATE ON genai_knowledge_db.products FROM 'llm_agent_user'@'localhost';

-- 4. Apply privilege changes
FLUSH PRIVILEGES;
```
